;                 SCORE
;                 <+ ,SCORE ,BRICK-WALL-SCORE>> <SETG BRICK-WALL-SCORE 0> % <IFSOUND <SOUNDS ,S-ELCRSH>> <COND
;                 (<HEAR-CHAIN?> <CHAIN-NOISES> <TELL "tearing, rending sound, then a rumbling
