;       (<NOT
;         <FSET? ,PRSO ,TAKEBIT>> <COND (.VB <TELL-YUKS>)> <RFALSE>)
;       (<IN? ,PRSO ,WINNER> <TELL ,YOU-HAVE "it" ,PERIOD> <RFALSE>)
;       (<AND
