; --- IWEAR ---
; <ROUTINE IWEAR ()
;   <COND
;       (<FSET? ,PRSO ,WEARBIT> <TELL ,YOU-ARE ,PERIOD> <RFALSE>)
;       (<NOT <HELD? ,PRSO>> <TELL ,YOU-ARENT " holding that!" CR> <RFALSE>)
